        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUDpLZSUabcKmHuCyD8LeSAUnrJRwK3Cw5TJohrhOs5-DKng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We worked with PC Land to redesign our network, set up a local Windows Server, and rebuild our website.\nThe entire process was well-planned and clearly explained from the outset. The network is now stable and properly segmented; the server is cleanly configured and documented, and everything works reliably on a day-to-day basis.\n\nWhat we appreciated most was the attention to detail and the fact that nothing was rushed or overcomplicated. Communication was clear, and support after installation has been solid.\n\nWe would definitely recommend PC Land for anyone looking for professional IT and networking services done properly.",
        "time": 1768503437,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andreia Simona",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105980471222314410366/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIVZp0eO9W0e0coCCFzyoN50S54Bz9g4Jx6S3g2rwRarscvjg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Since 2018, PC Land has been an indispensable partner for Accent Montreal, the Romanian publication for the Greater Montreal area. They didn't just build our digital home; they have been providing flawless hosting and maintenance for years. A reliable, long-term partner that we highly recommend for any professional organization.",
